# IIEC Student Admission Calling & Referral Program

## Program Overview

The IIEC Student Admission Calling & Referral Program is designed to create an opportunity for students to earn incentives by helping prospective students take admission into the university.

Under this program:
- Students will receive verified leads of prospective students.
- They will communicate with leads through calls, WhatsApp, and follow-ups.
- If the lead successfully completes:
  - ₹1,600 Registration Fee
  - ₹15,000 Initial Admission Fee
- The student ambassador/caller will receive an instant incentive of ₹500.

The program aims to:
- Increase admissions.
- Build student involvement in university growth.
- Develop communication and marketing skills among students.
- Create a performance-based earning opportunity.

