# 7. Sample Call Script

## Opening
“Hello, am I speaking with [Student Name]?

My name is [Your Name] from Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj University. You recently showed interest regarding admissions, so I wanted to guide you regarding courses, fees, placements, and admission process.”

