# 8. Incentive Rules & Policies

## Important Rules

1. Incentive only after verified admission.
2. Fake admissions are not allowed.
3. Self-admission referrals may require approval.
4. Duplicate claims are invalid.
5. Misbehavior with leads results in removal.
6. False promises or misinformation are prohibited.
7. Lead data must remain confidential.
8. Spam calling is prohibited.

